      "widgets_values": [
        "realistic, sensual, seductive. Professional studio photography of a stunning 25-year-old Caucasian female influencer. She possesses high cheekbones, a defined jawline, and an oval face shape, accentuating her natural beauty. Her blonde, slightly wet, shoulder-length hair glistens under the studio lights, framing her face perfectly. Her almond-shaped, light green eyes sparkle with intelligence and allure. Full lips with a defined cupid's bow complete her captivating features. She has an athletic, busty body type, radiating confidence and strength. The lighting is soft and diffused, creating a flattering and even illumination across her face and body. The background is a seamless, neutral gray, allowing the focus to remain solely on her. She is posed in a confident and engaging manner, making direct eye contact with the camera. The overall aesthetic is clean, modern, and sophisticated, reflecting her status as a successful and influential figure. Highly detailed skin texture, pores visible, 8k resolution, cinematic lighting. She is wearing a dark, form-fitting dress that accentuates her curves, adding a touch of elegance and glamour to the shot. The image is sharp and clear, capturing every detail with precision. [Optional: in the style of Annie Leibovitz].\n"
      ],
