          "version": "7.3",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## GEMINI 2.5 FLASH/PRO API  \n  \n* Model: For now, all models in the list is free to use (up to 1 million tokens) with Gemini API. This will most likely change at some point though.\n  \n* Max Output Tokens: keeping this between 800 - 10124 is good  \n  \n* **Temperature:** Controls randomness. **Low = Safe/Predictable**, **High = Creative/Random**. (Good starting point: 0.85)  \n  \n* **Top-P:** Creates a shortlist of the most probable words. A value of **0.95** considers the top 95% of likely choices. (This is the recommended method to use with Temperature).  \n  \n*   **Top-K:** Restricts the AI to a fixed number of choices. A value of **50** means it can only pick from the top 50 most likely words. (A simpler, more forceful control).  \n  \n## IMPORTANT  \nFor the Gemini 2.5 Flash/Pro node to work correctly, you must have a [Gemini API key](https://aistudio.google.com/apikey), the API key needs to be saved in a text file named: gemini_api_key.txt which (in Runpod) shoule be saved in /workspace/"
      ],
      "color": "#641f64",
      "bgcolor": "#500b50",
      "shape": 1
    },
